  "description": "Delibera — Thoughtful AI Decisions. A framework for collective decision making through structured AI deliberation. Supports multi-model councils with RAG (Qdrant, PgVector), debate strategies, Knowledge Keeper, Chairman roles, dependency injection, context compression, AutoChunking (progressive disclosure for large documents), Microsoft.Extensions.Logging, Microsoft.Extensions.Http.Resilience (Polly v8 retry pipelines), IHttpClientFactory wiring, response-language enforcement, parallel Operator requests, and full cooperative CancellationToken support across every async public method (rounds, LLM calls, MCP tools, RAG, file saves). v10.2.6 adds: async streaming council (IAsyncEnumerable<DebateRound>), pluggable voting engine (Majority/BordaCount/Weighted), debate persistence & resume via checkpoints, agent memory (in-memory/Qdrant/pgvector), OpenTelemetry-style observability (spans + metrics), structured JSON output (schema-validated verdicts with retry), adaptive strategy switching on stagnation, debate templates & presets library, HTML export, debate timeout, persona presets, benchmark mode, and participant limit guard.",
