  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v10.2.6 � Large feature release delivering nine new capabilities across observability, DX, enterprise decision support, persistence, and memory. Added: F-08 OpenTelemetry-style observability (DeliberaActivitySource + DeliberaMeter); F-10 Quick Wins Bundle (HtmlExporter, WithTimeout, 6 Persona presets, CouncilBenchmark, WithParticipantLimit); F-07 Debate Templates (6 built-in templates); F-01 Async Streaming Council (ICouncilExecutor.StreamDebateAsync with DebateRound.Total/IsFinal); F-09 Dynamic Strategy Switching (IStrategySelector + AdaptiveStrategySelector with Levenshtein fallback); F-02 Pluggable Vote Engine (IVotingStrategy + Majority/BordaCount/Weighted strategies + Chairman.CreateVoting); F-05 Structured Output (IStructuredOutputSerializer + JsonSchemaOutputSerializer + ExecuteTypedAsync<T> with retry); F-03 Debate Persistence (IDebateStore + FileDebateStore with atomic write-then-rename + ResumeFrom); F-04 Agent Memory (IAgentMemory + InMemory/Qdrant/PgVector implementations). 9 new ConsoleApp --flag demos. Fixed: CouncilMember.PersonaPrompt now assigned in constructor. 163 new unit tests; all 259 tests pass; no breaking changes � all new features are opt-in. v10.2.5 � OllamaProvider maxOutputTokens parameter fix. v10.2.4 � Full cooperative CancellationToken support. v10.2.3 � v10.2.0 � AutoChunking, Polly v8, parallel Operator, response language, logging, M.E.AI ChatClient bridge.",
